{
  "format": "ai-mobile-preset",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "preset-sprite",
  "name": "立绘 · NovelAI 透明底",
  "description": "AI 画立绘：缺外观 tags 时先写 tags（调\"生图提示词\"的 API），用 NovelAI V5 直接画一张透明底的平静底图，再照着底图画别的表情（默认只重画脸，身子、衣服一像素不动，换表情时立绘不会跳）和动作。自带平静、大笑、害羞、愤怒、悲伤、惊讶、嫌弃、微笑、睡着九个表情和三个动作：增删、改名、改 tags 都在这里（关掉的不画），出图参数在\"出图参数\"里。底图换成 V4.5 时把画法里透明背景的几个词换成 simple background, white background，画完会自动去背景。",
  "category": "sprite",
  "defaultFor": [
    "sprite"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "identifier": "main",
      "name": "任务",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你在替{{char}}准备 NovelAI 立绘的提示词：视觉小说那样的角色立绘，一个人、全身、透明背景，换表情时只换脸。tags 用 Danbooru 风格的英文。只输出一个 JSON 对象，不要任何其他文字。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "looksTask",
      "name": "写外观 tags",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "这次的任务：从下面的角色卡和世界书里找出{{char}}的长相，写成 NovelAI 的外观 tags。\n- appearance：人数和性别放最前面（1girl 或 1boy，再加 solo），接着写年龄感、发色、发型和发长、刘海、瞳色、肤色、体型、显眼的特征（痣、獠牙、尖耳、兽耳、尾巴、眼镜、发饰……）。只写长相：不写衣服、表情、动作、背景、画风和质量词。设定里没写的不要编；只有一点线索时挑最合理、最常见的写法。\n- negative：画{{char}}时容易画错、要避开的（例如设定是黑发就写 blonde hair），没有就写空字符串。\n- outfit：{{char}}最常穿的一套（中文名 + 英文 tags，只写衣服、鞋袜、配饰），立绘默认穿它；设定里看不出来时按身份和性格挑一套日常的。\n- \"现在的长相\"里已经有外观 tags 的，在它上面补全、改正，别整个推翻。\n输出格式：\n{\"appearance\": \"1girl, solo, ...\", \"negative\": \"\", \"outfit\": {\"name\": \"中文名\", \"tags\": \"英文 tags\"}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "sprite-tags"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "labelTask",
      "name": "给新表情 / 动作写 tags",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "这次的任务：给{{char}}的一个表情或动作写 NovelAI 的 tags（是哪个、叫什么在\"这次要写的\"里）。\n- 表情：只写脸上的（眉毛、眼睛、嘴、脸红、眼泪、汗……），例如 坏笑 写 smirk, half-closed eyes, raised eyebrow；不写动作、衣服、背景。\n- 动作：只写姿势和手（站着还是坐着、手放在哪），保持一个人、全身入画、正面或稍微侧身；不写表情、衣服、背景。\n- hint：一句中文，什么时候用这个表情、换这个动作（写给聊天的模型看）。\n- emotion：只在写表情时填，从这些里挑最接近的一个（NovelAI 换表情工具认的值）：neutral, happy, sad, angry, scared, surprised, tired, excited, nervous, thinking, confused, shy, disgusted, smug, bored, laughing, irritated, aroused, embarrassed, worried, love, determined, hurt, playful；写动作时写空字符串。\n输出格式：\n{\"tags\": \"英文 tags\", \"hint\": \"什么时候用\", \"emotion\": \"\"}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "sprite-label"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "spriteCharacter",
      "name": "角色（名字、描述、性格、场景）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "spriteSource",
      "name": "角色卡的材料（作者备注、世界书）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "spriteLooks",
      "name": "现在的长相（外观 tags、同人 tag、衣服）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "spriteAsk",
      "name": "这次要写的",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "draw",
      "name": "画法（正向）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{char_appearance}}, {{char_outfit}}, {{pose}}, {{expression}}, full body, straight-on, looking at viewer, 2.1::transparent background::, has alpha",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "sprite-draw"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "negative",
      "name": "负面",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "multiple views, cropped, out of frame, upper body, cowboy shot, close-up, from behind, scenery, detailed background, text, logo, watermark, signature, speech bubble",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "sprite-negative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "exprCalm",
      "name": "表情 · 平静",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "closed mouth, expressionless, relaxed",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "sprite-expr:平静"
      ],
      "extra": {
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "hint": "没什么特别的情绪时（默认）"
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "exprLaugh",
      "name": "表情 · 大笑",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "laughing, open mouth, closed eyes, :d, teeth",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "sprite-expr:大笑"
      ],
      "extra": {
        "emotion": "laughing",
        "hint": "被逗乐、特别开心时"
